            "review_title": "Review at Cung Dinh",
            "review_text": "Peech\nHong Kong, China235 contributions\n0\nnice environment for high end Vietnamese\nDec 2016 • Couples\nA friend recommended this place when I asked about high-end Vietnamese restaurants, as it was where his local colleagues chose to take him. \n\nBeware that on days where the Rex Hotel hosts a wedding banquet in the courtyard, this restaurant gets closed down as the kitchen will be busy serving the banquet.\n\nThe environment is clean and bright, and actually quite luxurious and tranquil. The manager seemed very pleasant and polite - as were other members of the staff.\n\nWe were only able to order a few dishes since there were only two of us, but I thought the quality of the dishes were pretty good, and the pricing reasonable.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten February 7, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
